{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you'll receive a set of new cards. Plan building placements carefully on the map. A wide variety of combinations unlock new possibilities for your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell unwanted items and purchase powerful cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a powerful army and command your units!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom will provide the warriors \u2014 your task is to manage them wisely in turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fights against the forces of evil, you\u2019ll need to position your units strategically to minimize losses and boost combat efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This won\u2019t be an easy journey \u2014 but that will make victory all the sweeter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972050?t=1757357750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972050/4fdfb3cd3ed16c36549a6c8d3bab15f36e7eeeae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757357750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972050/ea22bdbb07072fcb4745e0dcb4799a7a901b3416/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757357750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972050/ea22bdbb07072fcb4745e0dcb4799a7a901b3416/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757357750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you'll receive a set of new cards. Plan building placements carefully on the map. A wide variety of combinations unlock new possibilities for your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell unwan